  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Moroccan&#x2013;Dutch Cooperation in Higher and Vocational Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this government-to-government (G2G) project is to strengthen cooperation between Morocco and the Netherlands in the fields of Higher Education (HO) and Technical and Vocational Education and Training (TVET) under the existing bilateral Memorandums of Understanding (MoUs). Furthermore, this cooperation aims to support Moroccan public institutions in their task of enhancing educational quality, linking education to labor market needs, and promoting innovation through public-private partnerships (PPP) and triple helix collaboration (government&#x2013;academia&#x2013;industry). Through a study visit to the Netherlands, the Moroccan delegation will exchange knowledge and experiences, finalise joint Action Plans, and prepare for further implementation of the MoUs in 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
